[I] Fast C++ logging library

[T] spdlog is a very fast C++ logging library usable header-only or as a
[T] compiled library. It uses the fmt library for formatting and supports
[T] asynchronous logging, rotating files, syslog, colored console output and
[T] custom sinks.

[U] https://github.com/gabime/spdlog

[A] Spdlog Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

[V] 1.17.0
[L] MIT
